        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/2eaa96a4e1b01b95bf5b15327167a4b2.avif?t=1764017368\" width=571 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream big. Shoot bigger.</strong> Zaxtron EXPLUS is a turbo‑charged, score‑chasing arcade shmup set inside a kid’s late‑night dream. Choose from 6 weapons (each with an alt‑fire), melt screen‑filling bosses, and chase multipliers across Normal, Hard, Boss Rush, and the bonus <strong>Space Monsters</strong> mode—a love letter to classic ’80s Space Invaders—pulsing with a soundtrack by <strong>Filippo Game Audio</strong> <i>(Vampire Survivors, Hill Climb Racing, LEGO® Hill Climb Adventures)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1764017368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the weekend. Sammy sneaks in “one more run” on the AGES Master Drive after everyone’s asleep… and drifts off mid‑game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to his dream—where he’s strapped into a jetpac <strong>inside</strong> the cartridge, dodging neon bullet curtains and blasting anything that moves. <strong>Zaxtron EXPLUS</strong> blends chunky retro charm with modern shmup intensity for that perfect <i>just‑one‑more‑credit</i> hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1764017368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <strong>Why You’ll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Ways to Wreck:</strong> Pick from <strong>6 distinct weapons</strong>, each with a satisfying <strong>alternate fire</strong> to carve lanes, erase swarms, or crack boss armor when the screen gets spicy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modes for Any Mood:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong> – learn patterns, build confidence, and rack up medals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode 99HP -</strong> practice your runs and learn bullet patterns with a chunky 99HP to spend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong> – denser bullet curtains and razor‑thin dodges for score fiends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush</strong> – a non‑stop gauntlet of dream lords like <strong>Cloudy Boy</strong>, <strong>Squid King</strong>, <strong>Tank King</strong>, <strong>Battleship</strong>, <strong>Volcano Russo</strong>, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Monsters</strong> – a bonus, pick‑up‑and‑play tribute to the purest form of arcade bliss: classic <strong>Space Invaders</strong> vibes with modern snap.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score Chaser’s Playground:</strong> Pump your <strong>multiplier</strong>, scoop <strong>medals</strong>, time your <strong>bombs</strong>, and master routes through zones like the <strong>Nature Reserve</strong>, <strong>Htoh Region</strong>, and <strong>Military Base</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Look, Modern Feel:</strong> Crisp pixel art, screen‑filling patterns, punchy hits, and quick restarts keep the adrenaline flowing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn It Up:</strong> A soundtrack by <strong>Filippo Game Audio</strong> <i>(Vampire Survivors, Hill Climb Racing, LEGO® Hill Climb Adventures)</i> supercharges every dodge  with thumping, unforgettable hooks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whether you grew up chasing high scores or you’re discovering shmups for the first time, <strong>Zaxtron EXPLUS</strong> is built for instant fun and deep mastery. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strap on the jetpac, boost through the dream, and show Sammy how it’s done!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/b3e71521c3d5b30494682dd6cf86b62b.avif?t=1764017368\" width=189 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.apng?t=1764017368\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc482.poster.avif?t=1764017368\" class=\"bb_img\" width=57 height=98 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Updates – Year One Roadmap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are committed to expanding the game with free major updates in the first year after launch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned content includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode Boss Rush</strong> – face every boss in their hard mode variant back-to-back with no room for error.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus Game</strong> – an entirely new extra mode for players who want variety beyond the main campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Additional Stages</strong> – expanding the core game with new levels, enemies, and patterns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXTREME Mode</strong> – the ultimate test of skill, designed for expert STG players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of these updates will be added progressively over the first year after release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
